  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Booking Guard 4: weekly summary\nEvery Monday it counts last week's completed jobs, no-shows, cancellations, late cancellations, weather moves and access problems from your sheet, adds a row to the Report tab and emails you.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with tabs Bookings and Report using the CSV headers in the sheet-templates folder; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. Fill in the Config node: business name, owner email, time zone offset (for example -05:00), channel (sms or email), deposit amount and your own Stripe/PayPal payment link, notice hours.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth: Account SID / Auth Token) if you use SMS.\n4. Execute once with test rows, then activate.\n5. After each job set the Bookings status to Completed or No-show.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
